[I] Fast and simple system info written in C

[T] afetch is a fast and simple multithreaded system information tool for
[T] UNIX based operating systems, written in POSIX compliant C99 and
[T] configured at compile time by editing config.h.

[U] https://github.com/13-CF/afetch

